# Ask when something is missing

If the request depends on something that is not in the message or the project, stop and ask for it before doing the work.

This includes an attached image, file, link, name, or measurement the message refers to but does not include.

```text
User: Build the station from the attached reference image.
No image is attached.

Ask: The reference image isn’t attached. Send it and I’ll match the station to it.
```

A written description alone is not a substitute for a missing attachment. Wait for the missing piece, then continue.
